<section id="mission">
    <div class="inner">
        <div class="mission-left gsap-reveal" id="missionLeft">
            <div class="section-eyebrow"><span></span> Our Purpose</div>
            <h2 class="section-heading">We exist to <em>end the chaos</em> of disconnected data</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Every enterprise runs on dozens of tools that never quite speak to each other. Sales data lives in one silo, support tickets in another, and your team spends more time copy-pasting than actually thinking. LinkFlow closes that gap permanently.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-right" id="missionRight">
            <div class="mission-point gsap-reveal">
                <div class="mission-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" /></svg></div>
                <div><h3>Real-time signal ingestion</h3><p>Every event — a form submission, a Stripe charge, a Slack message — is ingested the moment it happens and routed through your custom logic without latency.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-point gsap-reveal">
                <div class="mission-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 0 0 0 14.14" /></svg></div>
                <div><h3>AI-native decision layer</h3><p>FluxEngine sits at the centre, using large language models to interpret context, classify intent, and decide the right action — no hard-coded rules required.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-point gsap-reveal">
                <div class="mission-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2" /><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" /></svg></div>
                <div><h3>Enterprise-grade security</h3><p>SOC 2 Type II certified, end-to-end encryption at rest and in transit, role-based access control, and full audit logging on every workflow run.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-point gsap-reveal">
                <div class="mission-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="10" /><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="4" /><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="16" /></svg></div>
                <div><h3>Observability built in</h3><p>Every workflow step emits structured logs and traces. Debug failures, measure throughput, and set SLA alerts from a single dashboard.</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
    <div class="inner">
        <div class="gsap-reveal" id="howHeader">
            <div class="section-eyebrow"><span></span> The Process</div>
            <h2 class="section-heading">From raw signal <em>to resolved action</em> in four steps</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">LinkFlow abstracts the hard parts — auth, retries, schema mapping, error handling — so you can focus purely on business logic.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps-grid" id="howGrid">
            <div class="step-card gsap-reveal"><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Connect your sources</h3><p>Authenticate your tools in one click. LinkFlow speaks OAuth, API keys, webhooks, and database connections natively — no middleware needed.</p><span class="step-tag">Ingestion</span></div>
            <div class="step-card gsap-reveal"><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Define your triggers</h3><p>Choose the events that matter: a new deal stage, a support ticket above severity 3, a shipment delay. Visual or YAML — your choice.</p><span class="step-tag">Logic</span></div>
            <div class="step-card gsap-reveal"><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Let FluxEngine decide</h3><p>The AI layer reads context from across your connected tools, enriches each event, and determines the optimal next action automatically.</p><span class="step-tag">AI</span></div>
            <div class="step-card gsap-reveal"><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Actions fire, you review</h3><p>Emails send, tickets update, dashboards refresh, Slack pings land. Every run is logged with a full trace so you can audit or replay any moment.</p><span class="step-tag">Output</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="integrations gsap-reveal" id="howIntegrations">
            <p>Connects natively with</p>
            <div class="logos-row">
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#4285F4"></span> Google Workspace</div>
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#E01E5A"></span> Slack</div>
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#00A4EF"></span> Salesforce</div>
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#635BFF"></span> Stripe</div>
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#0052CC"></span> Jira</div>
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#FF7A59"></span> HubSpot</div>
                <div class="logo-pill"><span class="dot" style="background:#336443"></span> + 330 more</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

